  "resume": "This is a 22-second video clip from the Swiss public broadcaster SFDRS, documenting an FDP parliamentary group excursion in Heiden, Appenzell Ausserrhoden, on June 13, 2007. It includes statements by party members Felix Gutzwiller, Pascal Couchepin, and Fulvio Pelli, filmed during a visit to a tableware factory. The footage touches on political discussions regarding the rejection of the second pillar pension reform in the Council of States."
